WEBVTT

1
00:00:32.875 --> 00:00:37.416
In verses 15.12 to 15.14,

2
00:00:37.416 --> 00:00:42.041
Lord Krishna described how He
supports life at the cosmic,

3
00:00:42.041 --> 00:00:45.291
earthly, and bodily levels.

4
00:00:45.291 --> 00:00:46.833
Now He reveals the most

5
00:00:46.833 --> 00:00:49.458
intimate support of all –

6
00:00:49.458 --> 00:00:53.625
His presence within the heart of every being.

7
00:00:53.625 --> 00:00:57.291
Where the earlier verses were
focused on outer arrangements,

8
00:00:57.291 --> 00:01:01.208
this fifteenth verse turns inward.

9
00:01:01.208 --> 00:01:03.833
It speaks of the guidance

10
00:01:03.833 --> 00:01:04.833
that Lord Krishna Himself

11
00:01:04.833 --> 00:01:07.125
gives from within our own hearts.

12
00:01:12.041 --> 00:01:13.708
Lord Krishna says –

13
00:01:13.708 --> 00:01:16.708
‘I am seated within the heart of every being.’

14
00:01:16.708 --> 00:01:18.458
This is not a metaphor

15
00:01:18.458 --> 00:01:21.166
but a deep truth.

16
00:01:21.166 --> 00:01:22.583
He dwells within us

17
00:01:22.583 --> 00:01:24.958
as the Paramatma –

18
00:01:24.958 --> 00:01:29.250
as a witness, as a guide.

19
00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:32.208
Memory, forgetfulness,

20
00:01:32.208 --> 00:01:35.458
and knowledge – all of these come from Him.

21
00:01:35.458 --> 00:01:37.875
Even forgetfulness is a form of compassion.

22
00:01:37.875 --> 00:01:40.458
If a person remembered the pain
of all their lifetimes,

23
00:01:40.458 --> 00:01:42.250
the present life

24
00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:44.416
would become unbearable.

25
00:01:44.416 --> 00:01:48.291
Forgetfulness gives us the opportunity
for a new beginning.

26
00:01:48.291 --> 00:01:50.916
Knowledge too arises from Him.

27
00:01:50.916 --> 00:01:54.166
Sometimes it comes as inner inspiration,

28
00:01:54.166 --> 00:01:56.333
sometimes through the words of a teacher,

29
00:01:56.333 --> 00:01:58.333
a friend, or a book.

30
00:01:58.333 --> 00:02:00.916
But its original source is the same –

31
00:02:00.916 --> 00:02:04.375
Lord Krishna present in our heart.

32
00:02:04.375 --> 00:02:06.458
If we turn toward Him,

33
00:02:06.458 --> 00:02:09.666
He gives memory and clarity.

34
00:02:09.666 --> 00:02:11.375
If we drift away

35
00:02:11.375 --> 00:02:13.166
in desires,

36
00:02:13.166 --> 00:02:15.583
He respects our free will

37
00:02:15.583 --> 00:02:17.708
and allows forgetfulness to happen.

38
00:02:17.708 --> 00:02:18.916
This is the love of a patient

39
00:02:18.916 --> 00:02:20.166
father –

40
00:02:20.166 --> 00:02:24.291
who does not force, but always watches,

41
00:02:24.291 --> 00:02:27.916
and gives support when the time comes.

42
00:02:27.916 --> 00:02:29.666
The second part of the verse

43
00:02:29.666 --> 00:02:32.291
points to the Vedas.

44
00:02:32.291 --> 00:02:33.958
Lord Krishna says –

45
00:02:33.958 --> 00:02:36.666
the true purpose of all the Vedas

46
00:02:36.666 --> 00:02:38.375
is to know Me.

47
00:02:38.375 --> 00:02:40.625
I am the source of Vedanta

48
00:02:40.625 --> 00:02:43.625
and the knower of the Vedas too.

49
00:02:43.625 --> 00:02:47.083
Just as the real meaning of a book

50
00:02:47.083 --> 00:02:49.541
can only be understood from its author,

51
00:02:49.541 --> 00:02:51.083
in the same way the true

52
00:02:51.083 --> 00:02:52.541
purpose of the Vedas

53
00:02:52.541 --> 00:02:54.875
can only be understood from Lord Krishna.

54
00:02:54.875 --> 00:02:57.875
He placed knowledge within us,

55
00:02:57.875 --> 00:03:01.333
placed the scriptures around us, and

56
00:03:01.333 --> 00:03:04.625
is patiently leading us toward truth.

57
00:03:04.625 --> 00:03:06.208
With this verse, Lord Krishna

58
00:03:06.208 --> 00:03:08.916
concludes the section on developing
the eye of wisdom.

59
00:03:08.916 --> 00:03:09.750
For those

60
00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:12.541
who cannot yet perceive the soul,

61
00:03:12.541 --> 00:03:14.625
for them, He says –

62
00:03:14.625 --> 00:03:17.458
experience and accept that this

63
00:03:17.458 --> 00:03:21.416
entire world is governed by Me.

64
00:03:21.416 --> 00:03:24.333
For those ready to go deeper –

65
00:03:24.333 --> 00:03:27.583
know that I live in your heart

66
00:03:27.583 --> 00:03:31.125
and guide your thoughts.

67
00:03:31.125 --> 00:03:34.791
And for those seeking knowledge – know

68
00:03:34.791 --> 00:03:37.083
that all scriptures ultimately

69
00:03:37.083 --> 00:03:39.125
lead to Me.

70
00:03:43.916 --> 00:03:45.333
In life

71
00:03:45.333 --> 00:03:48.208
there are some memories

72
00:03:48.208 --> 00:03:51.625
you want to erase –

73
00:03:51.625 --> 00:03:53.041
harsh words,

74
00:03:53.041 --> 00:03:57.000
broken trust, painful moments.

75
00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:59.458
And sometimes, however much

76
00:03:59.458 --> 00:04:02.500
you distract yourself,

77
00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:06.625
they stay in the mind.

78
00:04:06.625 --> 00:04:09.041
Understand this deeply –

79
00:04:09.041 --> 00:04:12.125
just as memory

80
00:04:12.125 --> 00:04:14.375
comes from Me,

81
00:04:14.375 --> 00:04:19.041
so does forgetfulness.

82
00:04:19.041 --> 00:04:22.583
It too is My gift.

83
00:04:22.583 --> 00:04:26.041
If a relative or friend

84
00:04:26.041 --> 00:04:29.708
has insulted you out of misunderstanding,

85
00:04:29.708 --> 00:04:32.875
rather than reacting immediately,

86
00:04:32.875 --> 00:04:34.458
try to let go

87
00:04:34.458 --> 00:04:38.833
of that bitter memory.

88
00:04:38.833 --> 00:04:43.041
When they realise their mistake,

89
00:04:43.041 --> 00:04:44.708
they will come on their own.

90
00:04:44.708 --> 00:04:46.875
Until then,

91
00:04:46.875 --> 00:04:51.166
so that the sharp memory of that insult

92
00:04:51.166 --> 00:04:56.791
does not keep you unbalanced –
forgetfulness is a gift.

93
00:04:56.791 --> 00:04:59.916
When needed, embrace it.

94
00:04:59.916 --> 00:05:04.125
Forgetfulness is not weakness –

95
00:05:04.125 --> 00:05:06.291
it is a form of compassion.

96
00:05:06.291 --> 00:05:11.375
If every wound remained in memory always,

97
00:05:11.375 --> 00:05:15.666
life would become unbearable.

98
00:05:15.666 --> 00:05:20.208
Forgetfulness gives you a new opportunity –

99
00:05:20.208 --> 00:05:24.250
to live again with hope.

100
00:05:24.250 --> 00:05:25.541
If there is a

101
00:05:25.541 --> 00:05:29.333
burden you wish to leave behind,

102
00:05:29.333 --> 00:05:32.875
do not run from it.

103
00:05:32.875 --> 00:05:35.208
Turn inward.

104
00:05:35.208 --> 00:05:37.583
With a sincere heart,

105
00:05:37.583 --> 00:05:39.875
pray to Me.

106
00:05:39.875 --> 00:05:45.416
When you hand Me the burden of your heart,

107
00:05:45.416 --> 00:05:48.416
I gradually loosen

108
00:05:48.416 --> 00:05:52.208
the bonds of that pain.

109
00:05:52.208 --> 00:05:55.666
Fighting with yesterday

110
00:05:55.666 --> 00:05:58.833
only deepens the pain.

111
00:05:58.833 --> 00:06:00.458
But remembering Me

112
00:06:00.458 --> 00:06:04.583
dissolves that pain gently.

113
00:06:04.583 --> 00:06:05.666
True mental

114
00:06:05.666 --> 00:06:10.250
peace begins not in fighting the past, but

115
00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:16.041
when you learn to trust Me

116
00:06:16.041 --> 00:06:18.500
and make a new beginning.

117
00:06:23.166 --> 00:06:25.291
In family life,

118
00:06:25.291 --> 00:06:28.166
forgiveness is essential.

119
00:06:28.166 --> 00:06:35.958
But the soul truly feels healed

120
00:06:35.958 --> 00:06:42.375
when you also learn forgetfulness –
the ability to let go and move on.

121
00:06:42.375 --> 00:06:44.833
I said –

122
00:06:44.833 --> 00:06:47.708
‘Memory comes from Me,

123
00:06:47.708 --> 00:06:51.208
and so does forgetfulness.

124
00:06:51.208 --> 00:06:56.500
Just as I give you precious memories,

125
00:06:56.500 --> 00:07:02.208
I also give the gift of forgetting –

126
00:07:02.208 --> 00:07:05.041
so that old wounds

127
00:07:05.041 --> 00:07:07.916
do not keep adding to your burden.’

128
00:07:07.916 --> 00:07:12.750
In the home, when someone hurts you,

129
00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:18.166
forgiveness loosens the grip of anger.

130
00:07:18.166 --> 00:07:21.666
But forgetfulness –

131
00:07:21.666 --> 00:07:26.416
meaning not replaying that pain
again and again –

132
00:07:26.416 --> 00:07:29.750
is what truly frees you.

133
00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:34.250
This does not mean nothing happened.

134
00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:37.791
It means you learn to see each other

135
00:07:37.791 --> 00:07:41.125
with new eyes –

136
00:07:41.125 --> 00:07:44.208
not through the haze of yesterday,

137
00:07:44.208 --> 00:07:47.041
but with the clear sight of the present.

138
00:07:47.041 --> 00:07:51.083
When you pray with a humble heart,

139
00:07:51.083 --> 00:07:54.958
I give you the strength

140
00:07:54.958 --> 00:08:00.416
to let go with ease, not by force.

141
00:08:00.416 --> 00:08:02.166
Through grace.

142
00:08:02.166 --> 00:08:05.541
And when forgiveness

143
00:08:05.541 --> 00:08:09.208
and forgetfulness flow together

144
00:08:09.208 --> 00:08:10.916
in a home,

145
00:08:10.916 --> 00:08:15.000
that home naturally becomes a shelter of love.

146
00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:22.375
Many people believe

147
00:08:22.375 --> 00:08:25.541
that creativity is either a talent

148
00:08:25.541 --> 00:08:30.166
received at birth, or a capacity that can

149
00:08:30.166 --> 00:08:34.541
be acquired through hard work.

150
00:08:34.541 --> 00:08:37.375
But true creativity

151
00:08:37.375 --> 00:08:40.708
is not limited to these alone.

152
00:08:40.708 --> 00:08:44.333
It is born when your sincere

153
00:08:44.333 --> 00:08:48.708
effort meets My silent grace.

154
00:08:48.708 --> 00:08:52.750
I have said – memory, knowledge,

155
00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:57.833
and inspiration – all come from Me.

156
00:08:57.833 --> 00:09:00.291
So work hard,

157
00:09:00.291 --> 00:09:04.125
be sincere, keep refining your skills.

158
00:09:04.125 --> 00:09:08.958
But also remember – new ideas,

159
00:09:08.958 --> 00:09:10.500
deep insights,

160
00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:14.500
and unique solutions do not come
only from pressure.

161
00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:18.958
They come when your dedicated effort

162
00:09:18.958 --> 00:09:20.250
is joined with humility

163
00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:24.541
and trust in Me.

164
00:09:24.541 --> 00:09:27.416
When your heart is pure,

165
00:09:27.416 --> 00:09:29.291
your intention is true,

166
00:09:29.291 --> 00:09:32.208
and your commitment is steady –

167
00:09:32.208 --> 00:09:37.333
I open new doors within you.

168
00:09:37.333 --> 00:09:42.500
Sometimes an idea flashes like
lightning in an instant.

169
00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:44.333
And sometimes a solution

170
00:09:44.333 --> 00:09:48.125
emerges slowly after days

171
00:09:48.125 --> 00:09:49.750
of stillness.

172
00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:51.375
So do not

173
00:09:51.375 --> 00:09:55.125
only push yourself into more effort.

174
00:09:55.125 --> 00:10:00.000
Do every piece of work with a spirit of devotion

175
00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:03.583
and keep your trust in Me.

176
00:10:03.583 --> 00:10:06.416
Creativity does not bloom from control –

177
00:10:06.416 --> 00:10:09.500
it blossoms from the meeting of your effort

178
00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:14.458
and My unseen support.
